  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of actuarial technical advice to strengthen social protection for Sahel region.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government Actuary&#x2019;s Department (GAD) provide actuarial technical assistance to the Centre for Disaster Protection (CDP), the World Bank and The Foreign Commonwealth and Development Office (FCDO).  The actuarial solutions provided include disaster risk finance analysis, modelling, predictive tools and financing instruments to support adaptive social protection for countries in Sahel region.</narrative>
  </description>
